  <p class="gd-lede">If you have never done one, a heli-ski week can be hard to picture. How does it start, what does a typical ski day feel like, what happens when the weather closes in, and how does it end? This is an honest, day-by-day walk through a heli-ski week in Iceland, from the arrival evening to the last run, so you know exactly what you are booking, before you look at <a href="/packages">the packages</a>.</p>
